    "description": "SOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS/DINGS/DENTS\nALL ITEMS SOLD AS IS\nTitle\n: Arrowhead Collectibles Lot of 10 Stone Rock Points Assorted Shapes Collection\nColor\n: Multi-color\nMaterial\n: Stone\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nSize:\n2\" - 3 3/4\"\nDepartment\n: Collectibles\nDescription\n: Add distinction to your collection with this lot of 10 stone arrowhead-shaped rock replicas. Each piece is individually shaped and displays unique earthy colors, ranging from deep browns and greens to lighter tan and gray hues. The assortment features a variety of classic arrowhead forms and textures, giving each piece a distinct character and appeal. These items showcase natural stone surfaces and the handcrafted flaking associated with traditional arrowhead motifs, ideal for display, education, or as conversation pieces. Their solid stone construction ensures durability, making them suitable for handling or display in a range of settings. This lot is perfect for collectors, educational projects, or enthusiasts looking for realistic, visually interesting stone artifacts. The items are shown in used, visibly handled condition, with surface wear, minor edge chips, and natural texture variations apparent on each specimen. Please review images for additional details\nBandera\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
